concept_mcqs.stem:
Developers misapplied spacing on cards: horizontal padding matches the spec but vertical is too tight. Your current tokens:
```json
{
  "spacing": {"sm": "8px", "md": "16px", "lg": "24px"},
  "component": {
    "card": {"padding": "{spacing.md}"}
  }
}
```
Which revision most reduces ambiguity in handoff without over-specifying per screen?

options:
```json
{
  "spacing": {"sm": "8px", "md": "16px", "lg": "24px"},
  "component": {
    "card": {"padding": {"vertical": "auto", "horizontal": "{spacing.md}"}}
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "spacing": {
    "inline-200": "16px",
    "block-300": "24px"
  },
  "component": {
    "card": {"padding": {"inline": "{spacing.inline-200}", "block": "{spacing.block-300}"}}
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "spacing": {"sm": "8px", "md": "16px", "lg": "24px"},
  "component": {
    "card": {"padding": "16px 24px"}
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "spacing": {"sm": "8px", "md": "16px", "lg": "24px"},
  "component": {
    "card": {"padding": {"all": "{spacing.md}"}}
  }
}
```
